OL,3,AMan hid woman's body in freezer for
OL,4,Athree years, jury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man killed a woman and hid her body
OL,7,Fin a freezer for almost three years
OL,8,Fwhile he took out credit cards and
OL,9,Floans in her name, a jury has been
OL,10,Ftold.
OL,12,FGeorge Gordon, 65, is accused of
OL,13,Fmurdering his friend Delia McInerney in
OL,14,FApril 2023, days before she was due to
OL,15,Fmove to Portugal for a "new life".
OL,17,FHer dismembered body was found in
OL,18,FGordon's flat in St Helens along with
OL,19,Fher five dead guinea pigs in January
OL,20,Fthis year.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
