OL,3,AMan hid woman's body in freezer for
OL,4,Athree years, jury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FGordon, who did not appear in the dock
OL,7,Fat Liverpool Crown Court, has admitted
OL,8,Fkilling Delia but claims it was self
OL,9,Fdefence and denies her murder.
